WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.299 --> 00:00:02.399
- This is a geoduck.

00:00:02.399 --> 00:00:05.114
It looks like a penis,
but its a shellfish.

00:00:05.114 --> 00:00:07.672
It is the largest burrowing
clam in the world,

00:00:07.672 --> 00:00:09.773
and it also is one of the
longest living animals

00:00:09.773 --> 00:00:10.891
of any type.

00:00:10.891 --> 00:00:13.425
It is native to the northwest
coast of North America,

00:00:13.425 --> 00:00:15.463
and since we're in Seattle for a weekend,

00:00:15.463 --> 00:00:16.880
we had to try it.

00:00:18.179 --> 00:00:20.762
(upbeat music)

00:00:24.927 --> 00:00:28.852
- [Gerry] So, I'm blaching
the geoduck in hot water

00:00:28.852 --> 00:00:31.971
and then going chuck it
real quick in some ice water

00:00:31.971 --> 00:00:33.874
to stop the cooking real quick.

00:00:33.874 --> 00:00:36.186
The only cooking that we did
was just so we could peel

00:00:36.186 --> 00:00:38.536
off the outer skin.

00:00:38.536 --> 00:00:41.119
(upbeat music)

00:00:53.910 --> 00:00:58.820
We have the siphon, the
belly, and the inner organs.

00:00:58.820 --> 00:01:02.153
You're going to eat the
siphon and the belly.

00:01:02.153 --> 00:01:06.485
We serve it sashimi style,
just thin, raw slices

00:01:06.485 --> 00:01:09.270
of both the belly and the siphon.

00:01:09.270 --> 00:01:10.347
Little bit of geoduck.

00:01:10.347 --> 00:01:11.338
Little bit of salt.

00:01:11.338 --> 00:01:14.838
Our lemon zest, followed by our shiso oil.

00:01:15.753 --> 00:01:20.158
Our red pepper curls
and our radish sprouts.

00:01:20.158 --> 00:01:21.825
- Alright, lets see.

00:01:23.863 --> 00:01:25.659
I read online that it tastes like cucumber

00:01:25.659 --> 00:01:26.637
and it kind of really does.

00:01:26.637 --> 00:01:28.060
In comparison with clams and oysters,

00:01:28.060 --> 00:01:29.426
I like this consistency better

00:01:29.426 --> 00:01:31.191
because it's not like mucus.

00:01:31.191 --> 00:01:32.777
I think this would be really good

00:01:32.777 --> 00:01:35.113
if it was breaded and deep fried,

00:01:35.113 --> 00:01:36.343
kind of like calamari.

00:01:36.343 --> 00:01:37.423
Now that would be my shit,

00:01:37.423 --> 00:01:39.053
cause calamari kind of
has the same consistency.

00:01:39.053 --> 00:01:40.945
That film would make it for me.

00:01:40.945 --> 00:01:42.203
- I'm afraid of most seafood,

00:01:42.203 --> 00:01:45.036
but I'm gonna face my fears today.

00:01:46.196 --> 00:01:47.308
Whoa.

00:01:47.308 --> 00:01:48.956
The coldness took me by surprise.

00:01:48.956 --> 00:01:50.293
It's very cold.

00:01:50.293 --> 00:01:51.802
It's just like really tender sushi,

00:01:51.802 --> 00:01:53.164
almost melts in your mouth.

00:01:53.164 --> 00:01:55.265
It's fishy, but it's not overwhelming.

00:01:55.265 --> 00:01:56.285
This is pretty good food.

00:01:56.285 --> 00:01:58.311
It tastes a lot less weird than it looks.

00:01:58.311 --> 00:01:59.932
Alright, Quileny, you're up.

00:01:59.932 --> 00:02:01.749
- Let's try something new.

00:02:01.749 --> 00:02:03.696
Not going to lie, the
body of the shellflish

00:02:03.696 --> 00:02:05.751
is sort of imposing and kind of looks like

00:02:05.751 --> 00:02:08.543
the downstairs part of a man,
if ya know what I'm saying.

00:02:08.543 --> 00:02:10.362
But in these thin little slices,

00:02:10.362 --> 00:02:12.195
it's a very sexy fish.

00:02:14.450 --> 00:02:16.064
Ugh, I had a really hard time,

00:02:16.064 --> 00:02:17.559
cause I don't want to make it seem gross,

00:02:17.559 --> 00:02:18.734
cause it tastes really good,

00:02:18.734 --> 00:02:20.713
but the way that it felt in my mouth.

00:02:20.713 --> 00:02:22.605
If you're someone who
eats based on texture,

00:02:22.605 --> 00:02:24.630
it might not be what you're into.

00:02:24.630 --> 00:02:25.681
- It's pretty tasty.

00:02:25.681 --> 00:02:26.514
- It is.

00:02:26.514 --> 00:02:28.519
I feel like, yeah, the
tastewise was really good,

00:02:28.519 --> 00:02:31.131
just texture for me wasn't the bag,

00:02:31.131 --> 00:02:31.964
but I totally agree.

00:02:31.964 --> 00:02:33.152
If you're going to come here,

00:02:33.152 --> 00:02:34.535
you should try everything at least once

00:02:34.535 --> 00:02:37.379
to figure out if it's for you.

00:02:37.379 --> 00:02:39.962
(upbeat music)

